# Search-walker exclusions (ripgrep / fd / Claude Code Grep+Glob honor .ignore with
# precedence ABOVE .gitignore, including when hidden-dir traversal is enabled).
#
# ROOT CAUSE FIX (2026-07-12): repo-root searches timed out at 20s because walkers
# traversed ~600k artifact files. Counts at fix time: target/ 276,653 files,
# .claude/worktrees/ 276,568 (agent worktrees, each with its own target/),
# Calyx source is NOT excluded (44k files, legitimately searchable).
# These trees are build artifacts / binary vaults / agent scratch - never text-search them.
/target/
/.claude/worktrees/
/local-asset-vault/
/tmp/
/.hf-cache/
/.playwright-mcp/
/.codex/
/.cargo/
